            "review_title": "Review at Slo Villa",
            "review_text": "comoxtravellwer\nCourtenay, Canada375 contributions\n0\nReturning to Hanoi\nOct 2012 • Friends\nI returned to HANOI after an absence of 44 years.I was looking for my Residence of that era when i found SLO VILLA.If my memory is correct,we lived on the other side of SLO VILLA.I do believe the SLO VILLA building is on the site of the former Residence of the British Consul General.We decided to have dinner there that evening,What a treat,the meal and ambiance was 5 star.The staff were most efficient and i found the prices reasonable.The Architecture of the Building was exactly the same as 44 years ago.I was fortunate in locating a Security person who was very knowledgeable and very informative.I definitely would return to SLO VILLA and remembering about the past and enjoying an excellent meal,but my clock is running slower now,been there,done that\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 21, 2012",
